From d854eddceabab87b9c5a4c52ab9c9b28ce17c5f8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Troy Lee <troy_lee@aspeedtech.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 15:17:06 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] composite_eat: add irot as backend

v1: Generate Composite EAT and submit to iROT(SSP) over MCTP-VDM for
    signing.

```
busctl call xyz.openbmc_project.SPDM \
        /xyz/openbmc_project/SPDM/CompositeEATBundle \
        xyz.openbmc_project.SPDM.CompositeEATBundle \
        Generate ay 32 \
                0 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 0 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 \
                0 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 0 1 2 3 4 5 6 7
busctl -l introspect xyz.openbmc_project.SPDM \
	/xyz/openbmc_project/SPDM/CompositeEATBundle
//...skip
xyz.openbmc_project.SPDM.CompositeEATBundle interface -         -                                                                                                    -
.Generate                                   method    ay        -                                                                                                    -
.Bundle                                     property  ay        4821 217 2 90 130 89 1 94 216 61 210 132 88 80 163 1 56 34 3 115 97 112 112 108 105 99 97 116 105... emits-change
.Status                                     property  s         "Ready"                                                                                              emits-change

```

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Troy Lee <troy_lee@aspeedtech.com>
